{"2417530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Button City: Soccer Days", "steam_appid": 2417530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ff6251b5cc7fd4e933dbe3f1f2b6cd02.poster.avif?t=1788282515\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ff6251b5cc7fd4e933dbe3f1f2b6cd02.webm?t=1788282515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer mania has come to Button City! People all over town are forming teams to play in the new Open Soccer Tournament. Fennel the fox and his scrappy group of friends team up in this charming soccer adventure, with an engaging story and adorable action gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your training in the story portions: Bond with your friends, manage your teammates, and make choices that impact your game and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy arcadey, action-packed soccer matches against rival teams, while also being ready for the unexpected! Overcome bad weather, injuries, and red cards that will affect the team's season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ebb89046607158fd5eee6ebee591b8ac.poster.avif?t=1788282515\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ebb89046607158fd5eee6ebee591b8ac.webm?t=1788282515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ff6251b5cc7fd4e933dbe3f1f2b6cd02.poster.avif?t=1788282515\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ff6251b5cc7fd4e933dbe3f1f2b6cd02.webm?t=1788282515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer mania has come to Button City! People all over town are forming teams to play in the new Open Soccer Tournament. Fennel the fox and his scrappy group of friends team up in this charming soccer adventure, with an engaging story and adorable action gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your training in the story portions: Bond with your friends, manage your teammates, and make choices that impact your game and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy arcadey, action-packed soccer matches against rival teams, while also being ready for the unexpected! Overcome bad weather, injuries, and red cards that will affect the team's season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ebb89046607158fd5eee6ebee591b8ac.poster.avif?t=1788282515\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417530/extras/ebb89046607158fd5eee6ebee591b8ac.webm?t=1788282515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Rejoin the wholesome cast of Butto